  "title": "Anonymous answers: the complete collection",
  "summary": "This collection contains excerpts from interviews with people whose work we respect and whose answers we offered to publish without attribution. This means that these quotes don't represent the views of 80,000 Hours, and indeed in some cases, individual pieces of advice explicitly contradict our own. Nonetheless, we think it's valuable to showcase the range of views on difficult topics where reasonable people might disagree. Did you just land on our site for the first time?",
